4. P3 — ЕДИНЫЙ ENGINE И РЕАЛЬНЫЙ TOOL LOOP
======================================================================

Вся агентная работа идёт через единственный канонический Engine.

Нет независимого AgentEngine внутри UI.
Нет скрытого отдельного Kilo agent loop в Desktop.
Нет второй реализации инструментов в VS Code/JetBrains.
Нет перехода к scripted executor при недоступности LLM.

Минимальный агентный путь должен быть настоящим:

Start task
 -> durable session/task creation
 -> real provider request
 -> parse provider response
 -> detect actual requested tool call
 -> validate tool schema and permission
 -> tool request persisted
 -> approval when required
 -> real tool execution
 -> persist actual output/exit code
 -> send result back to model
 -> continue until completion/failure/cancel
 -> verify final result
 -> persist terminal task state.

Если модель возвращает текст без tool call, это текстовый ответ.
Не создавать вымышленный tool call автоматически.

Если модель просит tool:
- validate schema;
- enforce permissions;
- record real call;
- execute only the allowed operation;
- return actual result.

Explorer:
- read-only;
- scope enforced in runtime.

Worker:
- limited write scope;
- no write outside assignment/worktree.

Verifier:
- independently verifies actual result and tests.

Director:
- owns task graph and dispatch decisions;
- does not directly mutate user files.

Parallel workers must be isolated. No two agents may silently write the same
workspace without conflict management.

Autonomy profiles:
- Review: approval for every mutating operation;
- Workspace Autopilot: pre-approved reversible operations inside a chosen
  workspace and explicitly configured command policy;
- restricted high-autonomy mode: only within an explicit target and capability
  set.

No autonomy mode grants unrestricted secret access, network access, privilege
escalation, publication, arbitrary deletion or out-of-workspace writes.

